  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rehabilitation of Andlos block 9 water station &#x2013; Jabal Awlia locality &#x2013; Khartoum State</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Alandlos block in Jabal Awliaa locality considered one of the areas that affected by the war and there is damage and stolen for the public services such as water and electricity. 
The total population in the area is about 15,000 individuals according to the development committee, most of the population displaced during the war and now 95% of them return to block and they suffer from shortage in all basic needs especially the water supply.</narrative>
  </description>
